<title>UK: Derwent buys property from MEPC.</title>
<headline>Derwent buys property from MEPC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment company Derwent Valley Holdings Plc said on Wednesday it is buying a property in London from MEPC Plc for 14.3 million stg.</p>
<p>It said current income from the property is 1.15 million stg per annum.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
